{"id":28724,"author":"Vior_","body":"\u003cdiv style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system-font; font-size: 12px; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; line-height: 16px;\"\u003e\u003ci\u003e\u003cu\u003e\u003c/u\u003e\u003c/i\u003e\u003cb\u003e\u003ci\u003e\u003cu\u003eBUILD APPLICATION:\u003c/u\u003e\u003c/i\u003e\u003c/b\u003e\u003cb\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003ePart 1: About You\u003c/b\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system-font; font-size: 12px; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; line-height: 16px;\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system-font; font-size: 12px; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; line-height: 16px;\"\u003eWhat is your age?\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system-font; font-size: 12px; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; line-height: 16px;\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system-font; font-size: 12px; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; line-height: 16px;\"\u003e\u003ci\u003eI am 13.\u003c/i\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system-font; font-size: 12px; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; line-height: 16px;\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system-font; font-size: 12px; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; line-height: 16px;\"\u003eWhat is your Discord ID? (If you don’t have Discord, create an account and join the Avicus Discord server before answering this question.)\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system-font; font-size: 12px; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; line-height: 16px;\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system-font; font-size: 12px; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; line-height: 16px;\"\u003e\u003ci\u003eVior#7403\u003c/i\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system-font; font-size: 12px; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; line-height: 16px;\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system-font; font-size: 12px; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; line-height: 16px;\"\u003eHow active can you be in order to contribute to the team?\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system-font; font-size: 12px; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; line-height: 16px;\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system-font; font-size: 12px; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; line-height: 16px;\"\u003e\u003ci\u003eI am looking to make from 1-4 maps monthly. It will vary on vacations, and the time of year.\u003c/i\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system-font; font-size: 12px; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; line-height: 16px;\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system-font; font-size: 12px; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; line-height: 16px;\"\u003eWhat attributes distinguish yourself from other applicants that qualify you to be a builder?\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system-font; font-size: 12px; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; line-height: 16px;\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system-font; font-size: 12px; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; line-height: 16px;\"\u003e\u003ci\u003eI am very active and willing to do whatever is needed for the building team. I want to make maps that people will enjoy the gameplay of and the look of. Also, I think that I am good at working with others and communicating which could really come in handy.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/i\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system-font; font-size: 12px; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; line-height: 16px;\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system-font; font-size: 12px; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; line-height: 16px;\"\u003e\u003cb\u003ePart 2: Skills\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system-font; font-size: 12px; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; line-height: 16px;\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system-font; font-size: 12px; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; line-height: 16px;\"\u003eWhat do you think is a necessity in order to hone your map building skills in terms of gameplay?\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system-font; font-size: 12px; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; line-height: 16px;\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system-font; font-size: 12px; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; line-height: 16px;\"\u003e\u003ci\u003eI think that in order to hone map building skills in terms of gameplay several things have to be done. First, I look for an inspiration whether it is a combination of blocks, or a map on a different server. From there I will try to make a unique design that has good elements of gameplay, and is good for certain strategies. (ex. sky bridging, tunneling, pushing to certain sides.) It doesn’t use many of the same concepts as the inspiration, but can be slightly distinguishable as similar to my build. The necessities are to work on building skills often, and look for concepts to use in your own maps.\u003c/i\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system-font; font-size: 12px; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; line-height: 16px;\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system-font; font-size: 12px; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; line-height: 16px;\"\u003eHow comfortable are you with Avicus XML when it comes to creating it and analyzing it to fix possible errors?\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system-font; font-size: 12px; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; line-height: 16px;\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system-font; font-size: 12px; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; line-height: 16px;\"\u003e\u003ci\u003eI have no experience with creating XML’s. I will be able to analyze possible errors, but not fix them.\u003c/i\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system-font; font-size: 12px; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; line-height: 16px;\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system-font; font-size: 12px; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; line-height: 16px;\"\u003eAs builder, would you focus on building maps, creating XML, or both?\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system-font; font-size: 12px; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; line-height: 16px;\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system-font; font-size: 12px; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; line-height: 16px;\"\u003e\u003ci\u003eI would focus on building maps, but taking this spot on the builder team would pursue me to learn how to XML.\u003c/i\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system-font; font-size: 12px; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; line-height: 16px;\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system-font; font-size: 12px; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; line-height: 16px;\"\u003e\u003cb\u003ePart 3: Past Experience\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system-font; font-size: 12px; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; line-height: 16px;\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system-font; font-size: 12px; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; line-height: 16px;\"\u003eProvide the links for the threads of two maps that you have submitted to the Avicus forums.\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system-font; font-size: 12px; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; line-height: 16px;\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system-font; font-size: 12px; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; line-height: 16px;\"\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://avicus.net/forums/discussions/4fc754b3f\" title=\"Link: https://avicus.net/forums/discussions/4fc754b3f\"\u003e\u003ci\u003ehttps://avicus.net/forums/discussions/4fc754b3f\u003c/i\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system-font; font-size: 12px; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; line-height: 16px;\"\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://avicus.net/forums/discussions/3dcbd1f21\" title=\"Link: https://avicus.net/forums/discussions/3dcbd1f21\"\u003e\u003ci\u003ehttps://avicus.net/forums/discussions/3dcbd1f21\u003c/i\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system-font; font-size: 12px; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; line-height: 16px;\"\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://avicus.net/forums/discussions/1dcdb4898\" title=\"Link: https://avicus.net/forums/discussions/1dcdb4898\"\u003e\u003ci\u003ehttps://avicus.net/forums/discussions/1dcdb4898\u003c/i\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003ci\u003e (new map)\u003c/i\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system-font; font-size: 12px; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; line-height: 16px;\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system-font; font-size: 12px; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; line-height: 16px;\"\u003eHave you had any past experience with building maps or creating XML, other than with the two maps linked above? If so, explain.\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system-font; font-size: 12px; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; line-height: 16px;\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system-font; font-size: 12px; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; line-height: 16px;\"\u003e\u003ci\u003eI do not have any past experience building maps (Ctw, DTM, CTF, etc.) I have made many builds though on other servers.\u003c/i\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system-font; font-size: 12px; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; line-height: 16px;\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system-font; font-size: 12px; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; line-height: 16px;\"\u003e\u003cb\u003ePart 4: Self Reflection\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system-font; font-size: 12px; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; line-height: 16px;\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system-font; font-size: 12px; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; line-height: 16px;\"\u003eWhy do you want to be a builder?\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system-font; font-size: 12px; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; line-height: 16px;\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system-font; font-size: 12px; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; line-height: 16px;\"\u003e\u003ci\u003eI want to be a builder because I want to create awesome/cool designs and maps for this server, because I have been on it forever and It would be amazing to see my own content on this server. I also love building maps, as I find it very fun to do especially with other people, and I think I have what it takes to be here.\u003c/i\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system-font; font-size: 12px; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; line-height: 16px;\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system-font; font-size: 12px; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; line-height: 16px;\"\u003eHow do you think you will help the map development team?\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system-font; font-size: 12px; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; line-height: 16px;\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system-font; font-size: 12px; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; line-height: 16px;\"\u003e\u003ci\u003eI want to give them options, and new ideas to add to the rotations. I want to help with fixing problems with current maps, as well as my own.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/i\u003e\u003c/div\u003e","body_tagged":"\u003cdiv style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system-font; font-size: 12px; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; line-height: 16px;\"\u003e\u003ci\u003e\u003cu\u003e\u003c/u\u003e\u003c/i\u003e\u003cb\u003e\u003ci\u003e\u003cu\u003eBUILD APPLICATION:\u003c/u\u003e\u003c/i\u003e\u003c/b\u003e\u003cb\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003ePart 1: About You\u003c/b\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system-font; font-size: 12px; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; line-height: 16px;\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system-font; font-size: 12px; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; line-height: 16px;\"\u003eWhat is your age?\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system-font; font-size: 12px; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; line-height: 16px;\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system-font; font-size: 12px; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; line-height: 16px;\"\u003e\u003ci\u003eI am 13.\u003c/i\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system-font; font-size: 12px; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; line-height: 16px;\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system-font; font-size: 12px; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; line-height: 16px;\"\u003eWhat is your Discord ID? (If you don’t have Discord, create an account and join the Avicus Discord server before answering this question.)\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system-font; font-size: 12px; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; line-height: 16px;\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system-font; font-size: 12px; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; line-height: 16px;\"\u003e\u003ci\u003eVior#7403\u003c/i\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system-font; font-size: 12px; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; line-height: 16px;\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system-font; font-size: 12px; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; line-height: 16px;\"\u003eHow active can you be in order to contribute to the team?\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system-font; font-size: 12px; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; line-height: 16px;\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system-font; font-size: 12px; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; line-height: 16px;\"\u003e\u003ci\u003eI am looking to make from 1-4 maps monthly. It will vary on vacations, and the time of year.\u003c/i\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system-font; font-size: 12px; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; line-height: 16px;\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system-font; font-size: 12px; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; line-height: 16px;\"\u003eWhat attributes distinguish yourself from other applicants that qualify you to be a builder?\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system-font; font-size: 12px; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; line-height: 16px;\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system-font; font-size: 12px; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; line-height: 16px;\"\u003e\u003ci\u003eI am very active and willing to do whatever is needed for the building team. I want to make maps that people will enjoy the gameplay of and the look of. Also, I think that I am good at working with others and communicating which could really come in handy.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/i\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system-font; font-size: 12px; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; line-height: 16px;\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system-font; font-size: 12px; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; line-height: 16px;\"\u003e\u003cb\u003ePart 2: Skills\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system-font; font-size: 12px; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; line-height: 16px;\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system-font; font-size: 12px; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; line-height: 16px;\"\u003eWhat do you think is a necessity in order to hone your map building skills in terms of gameplay?\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system-font; font-size: 12px; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; line-height: 16px;\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system-font; font-size: 12px; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; line-height: 16px;\"\u003e\u003ci\u003eI think that in order to hone map building skills in terms of gameplay several things have to be done. First, I look for an inspiration whether it is a combination of blocks, or a map on a different server. From there I will try to make a unique design that has good elements of gameplay, and is good for certain strategies. (ex. sky bridging, tunneling, pushing to certain sides.) It doesn’t use many of the same concepts as the inspiration, but can be slightly distinguishable as similar to my build. The necessities are to work on building skills often, and look for concepts to use in your own maps.\u003c/i\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system-font; font-size: 12px; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; line-height: 16px;\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system-font; font-size: 12px; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; line-height: 16px;\"\u003eHow comfortable are you with Avicus XML when it comes to creating it and analyzing it to fix possible errors?\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system-font; font-size: 12px; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; line-height: 16px;\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system-font; font-size: 12px; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; line-height: 16px;\"\u003e\u003ci\u003eI have no experience with creating XML’s. I will be able to analyze possible errors, but not fix them.\u003c/i\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system-font; font-size: 12px; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; line-height: 16px;\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system-font; font-size: 12px; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; line-height: 16px;\"\u003eAs builder, would you focus on building maps, creating XML, or both?\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system-font; font-size: 12px; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; line-height: 16px;\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system-font; font-size: 12px; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; line-height: 16px;\"\u003e\u003ci\u003eI would focus on building maps, but taking this spot on the builder team would pursue me to learn how to XML.\u003c/i\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system-font; font-size: 12px; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; line-height: 16px;\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system-font; font-size: 12px; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; line-height: 16px;\"\u003e\u003cb\u003ePart 3: Past Experience\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system-font; font-size: 12px; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; line-height: 16px;\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system-font; font-size: 12px; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; line-height: 16px;\"\u003eProvide the links for the threads of two maps that you have submitted to the Avicus forums.\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system-font; font-size: 12px; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; line-height: 16px;\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system-font; font-size: 12px; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; line-height: 16px;\"\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://avicus.net/forums/discussions/4fc754b3f\" title=\"Link: https://avicus.net/forums/discussions/4fc754b3f\"\u003e\u003ci\u003ehttps://avicus.net/forums/discussions/4fc754b3f\u003c/i\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system-font; font-size: 12px; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; line-height: 16px;\"\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://avicus.net/forums/discussions/3dcbd1f21\" title=\"Link: https://avicus.net/forums/discussions/3dcbd1f21\"\u003e\u003ci\u003ehttps://avicus.net/forums/discussions/3dcbd1f21\u003c/i\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system-font; font-size: 12px; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; line-height: 16px;\"\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://avicus.net/forums/discussions/1dcdb4898\" title=\"Link: https://avicus.net/forums/discussions/1dcdb4898\"\u003e\u003ci\u003ehttps://avicus.net/forums/discussions/1dcdb4898\u003c/i\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003ci\u003e (new map)\u003c/i\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system-font; font-size: 12px; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; line-height: 16px;\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system-font; font-size: 12px; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; line-height: 16px;\"\u003eHave you had any past experience with building maps or creating XML, other than with the two maps linked above? If so, explain.\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system-font; font-size: 12px; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; line-height: 16px;\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system-font; font-size: 12px; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; line-height: 16px;\"\u003e\u003ci\u003eI do not have any past experience building maps (Ctw, DTM, CTF, etc.) I have made many builds though on other servers.\u003c/i\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system-font; font-size: 12px; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; line-height: 16px;\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system-font; font-size: 12px; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; line-height: 16px;\"\u003e\u003cb\u003ePart 4: Self Reflection\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system-font; font-size: 12px; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; line-height: 16px;\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system-font; font-size: 12px; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; line-height: 16px;\"\u003eWhy do you want to be a builder?\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system-font; font-size: 12px; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; line-height: 16px;\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system-font; font-size: 12px; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; line-height: 16px;\"\u003e\u003ci\u003eI want to be a builder because I want to create awesome/cool designs and maps for this server, because I have been on it forever and It would be amazing to see my own content on this server. I also love building maps, as I find it very fun to do especially with other people, and I think I have what it takes to be here.\u003c/i\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system-font; font-size: 12px; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; line-height: 16px;\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system-font; font-size: 12px; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; line-height: 16px;\"\u003eHow do you think you will help the map development team?\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system-font; font-size: 12px; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; line-height: 16px;\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system-font; font-size: 12px; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; line-height: 16px;\"\u003e\u003ci\u003eI want to give them options, and new ideas to add to the rotations. I want to help with fixing problems with current maps, as well as my own.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/i\u003e\u003c/div\u003e","created_at":1514091673,"title":"Vior_ builder application","replies":[]}